      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MOLLY MCKAYLA (8) ran below best last time finishing fourth (22.64) over 390m at this track from Box 4. Should bounce back. PAW XHANI (1) has a terrific record this track and trip with two wins and one placing from three starts. Placed last time (22.61) at this track in a Grade 4/5, finishing third and beaten 6 lengths. Can hit the frame with the right run. WHODAT JEWEL (2) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by one length at this track in a handy 25.45 beating Oklahoma Bale. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in her latest win. Deserves serious consideration again. SAINT FINNIE (7) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can atone.",
